    ./p_tool.cue:5:8
command.tc3.NESTED: key value of dynamic field must be concrete, found _|_(command.tc3.NESTED: invalid interpolation: non-concrete value string (type string)):
    ./p_tool.cue:14:2
-- noTasks.stderr --
command.noTasks: no tasks found
-- undefinedSource.stderr --
